.SH NAME
p106\-stats \- generate local statistics from municipal 106
reports_raw.json exports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B p106\-stats
[\fB\-h\fR]
\fIcommand\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate local statistics from municipal 106 reports_raw.json exports.
\fBbuild\fR is fully offline: files are read locally, outputs are written
locally, nothing is uploaded. \fBrefresh\fR contacts the municipal API to
fetch the reporter's cases.
.PP
The build subcommand takes one or more export JSON files and writes
summary.json, the monthly/categories/streets CSVs and report.html into
\-\-output. Fully offline: no network, no credentials.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help message and exit.
.SS Arguments
.TP
\fIcommand\fR

.SS "build options"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Output directory for summary.json, the CSV tables and report.html.
Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-top\-streets\fR \fITOP_STREETS\fR
How many streets to keep in by_street (default: 20) Default: 20.
.TP
\fB\-\-plates\-ledger\fR \fIPLATES_LEDGER\fR
Optional private filing\-ledger CSV; adds a repeat\-plates aggregate
(plates.csv with plate,reports for 3+ distinct filed reports) \- the
ledger itself never leaves the machine.
.TP
\fB\-\-neighborhoods\fR \fINEIGHBORHOODS\fR
Optional UTF\-8 JSON file with one object mapping street name to
neighborhood name; fills by_neighborhood in summary.json (unmapped
streets count as (אחר)) and adds the neighborhood chart to
report.html.
.TP
\fIinputs\fR
Reports_raw.json export file(s)
.SS "refresh options"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Output directory for summary.json, the CSV tables and report.html.
Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-archive\fR \fIARCHIVE\fR
Archived reports_raw.json export (repeatable); fetched rows win when a
case_number appears in both. Default: [].
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fIFROM_DATE\fR
First case date to fetch, YYYY\-MM\-DD (default: 2021\-01\-01) Default:
