.TP
\fB\-\-top\-streets\fR \fITOP_STREETS\fR
How many streets to keep in by_street (default: 20) Default: 20.
.TP
\fB\-\-plates\-ledger\fR \fIPLATES_LEDGER\fR
Optional private filing\-ledger CSV (same aggregation as build)
.TP
\fB\-\-neighborhoods\fR \fINEIGHBORHOODS\fR
Optional UTF\-8 JSON file with one object mapping street name to
neighborhood name; fills by_neighborhood in summary.json (unmapped
streets count as (אחר)) and adds the neighborhood chart to
report.html.
.TP
\fB\-\-save\-union\fR \fISAVE_UNION\fR
Optional path for the merged raw export (PRIVATE: contains case texts;
keep outside any published repository)
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Summary.json, the CSV tables and report.html written to the output
directory; one summary line on stdout.
.TP
.B 1
Input error (missing, unreadable or invalid export file; an unreadable
\-\-plates\-ledger file; an unreadable or invalid \-\-neighborhoods file;
refresh: missing environment variables, a failed fetch or union, or an
unwritable \-\-save\-union path), \fBp106\-stats: ...\fR on stderr.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (argparse, or an invalid value such as \-\-top\-streets 0 or
a refresh \-\-from that is not a YYYY\-MM\-DD date), message on stderr.
